TlipocasScytheLegend: {
	Conditions: {
		DashTitle: Ability: Slash Dash
		StatTitle: Ability: Basic Stat
		TeleportTitle: Ability: Teleport Slash
		ThrowTitle: Ability: Throw
	}

	Ability: {
		TScytheA1: Hold Up and attack will push a certain distance towards the mouse direction
		TScytheA1B: Gain invincible time and deal damage to the targets you come into contact with
		TScytheA2: Press Left Click to throw the scythe and cause multiple injuries
		TScytheA2B:
			'''
			Press Left Click when throwing to teleport to the mouse and launch a larger slash
			This skill has a 30 second cooldown time, reduced to 20 seconds after killing Cruiser
			'''
		TScytheA3:
			'''
			When thrown out, press Right Click to let the scythe follow your curser
			Ultimate hits will heal you for 7 life
			'''
		TScytheA4:
			'''
			Teleport slash will empower your weapon with void.
			This will last for 8 seconds. After killing Cruiser, it will increase to 15 seconds
			Gain 20% increased damage while empowered
			'''
		TScytheA5:
			'''
			Leave a shadow when performing a teleport strike, the shadow will attack alongside you
			Slash dash will generate an additional slash perpendicular to the original
			Ultimate hits heal for 10 life instead
			'''
		TScytheA6: Leave rift when slash dash. The rift will continuously causing harm
		TScytheA7: Resist a fatal injury and restore your health to half of your maximum health.Need 5 min to cooling
		TScytheA8: Attacks inflict void touch
		TScytheA9: The closer the distance to the target, the higher the damage dealt, with a maximum additional damage of 25%
	}

	Downed: {
		TScytheU1: Take down Eye of Cthulhu
		TScytheU1B: Take down Apsychos
		TScytheU1BCal: Take down Slime God
		TScytheU2: Take down any evil boss
		TScytheU2B: Take down all mechanical bosses
		TScytheU2BCal: Take down Brimstone Elemental
		TScytheU3: Take down Prophet
		TScytheU4: Take down the Nihility Twins
		TScytheU5: Take down the Nihility Twins
		TScytheU5Cal: Take down Polterghast
		TScytheU6: Take down Cruiser
		TScytheU6Cal: Take down The Devourer of Gods
		TScytheU7: Take down Cruiser
		TScytheU7Cal: Take down Yharon
		TScytheU8: Take down Cruiser
		TScytheU9: Take down Cruiser
		TScytheU9Cal: Take down the Supreme Witch
		TWOF: Take down the Wall of Flesh
		TALLMECHBOSS: Take down all mechanical bosses
		TLevel2: Reach level 2
	}

	Dialog: {
		TScytheDia1:
			'''
			The evil big eyes seem to have ill intentions towards we...
			Let's go kill him!
			'''
		TScytheDia2:
			'''
			Strange spirits resembling brains and worms?
			Can I take it home to make a specimen？
			'''
		TScytheDia3:
			'''
			A giant worm clad in tectonic armor roams deep in the magma, its shell packed with wailing souls...
			Let's go knock them loose!
			'''
		TScytheDia4:
			'''
			A flesh and blood creation sealed with the spirit of the gods?
			It seems that completing this task can bring a lot of souls...
			'''
		TScytheDia5:
			'''
			Three huge machines wander the night, each imprisoning a mechanized soul...
			Let's take them all apart and see!
			'''
		TScytheDia6:
			'''
			Mechanical souls are so tough...
			Let's dismantle the remaining ones too, don't spare a single machine!
			'''
		TScytheDia7:
			'''
			There're so much spirits in the dungeon...
			Hey，there's a sealed spirit with strange scent
			I can't help but want to communicate with them!
			'''
		TScytheDia8:
			'''
			A crowd of fanatic cultists gathers at the dungeon's gate, their souls glinting in the moonlight...
			Let's go say hello!
			'''
		TScytheDia9:
			'''
			These crazy cultists emit an aura similar to that prophet...
			What are they worshiping? 
			It feels like sending them to worship the Grim Reaper is a good idea
			'''
		TScytheDia10: A huge, multi eyed octopus? Is this a monster that came out of a dream?
		TScytheDia11:
			'''
			A strange pair of creatures crawled out of a crack in reality,
			they carry no souls, only hollowness... how curious!
			'''
		TScytheDia12:
			'''
			Those nihility creatures will come again...
			This time, let's send them back through the rift for good!
			'''
		TScytheDia13: An unspeakable being peers from the void at night... I cannot see its soul, but I know it is there!
		TScytheDia14: A void serpent has made this world its hunting ground... the souls it devoured should be enough to pay off the debt, right?
		TScytheDia15:
			'''
			The serpent is still cruising out there...
			Master, let's go meet it again!
			'''
		TScytheDia16:
			'''
			The final battle! Hunt down that cruising serpent for good,
			and the soul debt will be fully repaid!
			'''
		TScytheDia17: Finally paid off the debt, the task was perfectly completed!
	}

	General.CurLevel: ""
	TlipocazKilledNPC: Press Middle Mouse to allow you slain friendly target
	TlipocazKilledNPCNot: Press Middle Mouse again to prevent you from killing friendly target
}

DCarverDia0:
	'''
	Was it you who awakened me?
	Indeed, as you can see, I have lost most of my power
	If you wish to prove yourself worthy of my service, first slay the Evil Eye!
	'''
DCarverDia1:
	'''
	Good, I can sense both you and I growing stronger
	Slay the spawn of the defiled land, and prove your might to me
	'''
DCarverDia2:
	'''
	You have proven your strength, but there is still a long road ahead
	I can now awaken my slumbering servants. If you defeat more powerful beings, you can awaken more of my followers
	Next, go deep into the magma and slay the worm clad in tectonic armor!
	'''
DCarverDia3: The time for reckoning has come. Go to the Foundation of the World, slay the twisted creation, and release the long-sealed soul
DCarverDia4: Stolen power flows through those three mechanical constructs. Destroy them all!
DCarverDia5:
	'''
	The mechanical wrecks are still roaring
	Dismantle the remaining ones as well, leave none intact
	The power within them was always meant to return to me
	'''
DCarverDia6: There is a restless stirring beneath the jungle. If we can eradicate its source, we might find a fragment of myself
DCarverDia7:
	'''
	Those cultists are gathering under the moon again
	The forbidden arts in their hands give off a familiar aura
	Go and end their ritual!
	'''
DCarverDia8:
	'''
	It is time to reclaim a sealed part of me from those cultists
	They once sacrificed me to summon their evil god
	'''
DCarverDia9: To protect this land and continue our journey, eradicate those outsiders completely!
DCarverDia10:
	'''
	A rift in reality has been torn open, and a pair of nihility creations is crawling through
	Strike before they find their footing!
	'''
DCarverDia11:
	'''
	The nihility twins will return
	This time, drive them back into the depths of the rift for good!
	'''
DCarverDia12: An unseen presence lurks beneath the night. No mortal can look upon it... but you can slay it
DCarverDia13:
	'''
	That serpent cruising through the void has set its eyes on this world
	It is time to face it head-on!
	'''
DCarverDia14:
	'''
	The serpent's presence still lingers
	Fight it once more, and show it who the true hunter is!
	'''
DCarverDia15: Put an end to that void serpent, reclaim the last of my power, and bring this journey to a close!
DCarverDia16: Our journey together has reached its conclusion, but many powerful enemies still await. Press on, my master!

General: {
	Locked: "[LOCKED]:"
	PagesTips: Hold Left Alt to directly read the ability, press Left Click to switch
}

SusiesBracelet: {
	Lores: {
		l0:
			'''
			Chapter 1 - The March of the Dark King
			The heroes defeat the king and stop the dragon
			'''
		l1:
			'''
			Chapter 2 - The City of the Shining
			The heroes do battle in chariots to save the Queen
			'''
		l2:
			'''
			Chapter 3 - The Isles of Northernlight
			The heroes travel among the islands, and catch a glimpse of a lost land
			'''
		l3:
			'''
			Chapter 4 - The Trials of the Holy Hammer
			A great smith gives the heroes a terrible weapon
			'''
		l4:
			'''
			Chapter 5 - The Field of Pink and Gold
			The vast garden is charred in an inferno of jealousy
			'''
		l5:
			'''
			There was only one more chapter...
			After that, It all stopped
			'''
		l6:
			'''
			That next book, it never did get written
			The story, it became so grand, so overwhelming,
			some say it swallowed up the author himself
			'''
		l7:
			'''
			The ones who could write the next, the youth,
			the pen was lying there for them to pick up
			To make the next page
			...they never did
			'''
		l8:
			'''
			But you, my dear?
			I see a story lit up in your eyes
			Burnin' bright...
			Burnin' black
			Burnin' up everything
			'''
		l9:
			'''
			The bell's ringin' now
			Seems we've reached the final rounds
			So... how do you think it all ends?
			No, how do you want it to end?
			'''
		l10:
			'''
			At this late hour, with the bells ringing out their justice
			You choose eternity
			'''
		l11:
			'''
			But... there is one thing that can overwrite the dark
			A white pen, known as hope
			I believe... this is what you hold
			'''
	}

	Trials: {
		Trial: Trial
		t0: Slime King
		t1: Eye of Cthulhu
		t2: Any evil boss
		t3: Skeletron
		t4: Wall of Flesh
		t5: All mech boss
		t6: Plantera
		t7: Golem
		t8: The Prophet
		t9: Moonlord
		t10: Trials - Done
	}
}
